ablement behavior for non-entitled clusters).\n- The Llama Stack management views render and function against a Llama Stack\n  distribution in the default configuration.\n- The Dashboard change builds and passes the Dashboard's existing build\n  pipeline.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-5 (P1)**: The Dashboard enables Llama Stack management by default for\n  entitled clusters (no TP opt-in gate). This epic is the entire deliverable of\n  HLR-5.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":33243,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f07deed22000dae","agent_id":"ac8b09bb5b58c9e2f","session_id":"1249e1cd-8cf6-43c9-b6fd-d1e7ae430a4a","uuid":"dffa97af-fded-4cd6-8ee1-9ec2f362df15","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:10:31.780Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9014"}
