eature development beyond GA-bar quality work\n41\t- Deprecating alternative GenAI serving paths\n42\t\n43\t## Open Questions\n44\t\n45\t1. The GA scope itself depends on HLR-1's assessment — until it lands, the\n46\t   size of the stability and hardening work is an estimate.\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc0024c29b472a89","agent_id":"a22d7c25e3fb9079a","session_id":"1249e1cd-8cf6-43c9-b6fd-d1e7ae430a4a","uuid":"b8f12925-44f7-45ac-934d-79f2a0c8de18","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:15:36.498Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8fccd442089c21bc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
